{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://opentine.com/schemas/tine-cli-judge-1.schema.json",
  "title": "tine judge VERB --json",
  "description": "Judge assurance (0.89). `classify` runs label judges (label, probability, explicit abstain; a parse failure is an error, never a 0) and ensembles whose members must be independent (copies of one judge count once). `label` signs one human rubric label with a pinned reviewer key; `queue` lists each reviewer's assigned and pending items; `agreement` reports judge-vs-human agreement with a bootstrap interval and floor; `validate` signs a judge or monitor validation (adversarial cases plus the floor); `independence` checks judges, monitors and eval items against the candidate's lineage; `injection` lists candidate outputs aimed at their judge (advisory).",
